## Interface: 120000, 120001, 120005
## Title: Odysseus Utility Suite
## Notes: A modular suite of quality-of-life tools for WoW Retail 12.0+ (Midnight). Includes XP/Rep tracking, Flight Master timing, Auto Remount, Stats Bar, Openables, Fishing Tracker, Faster Loot, and a Toolbox icon bar — all in one Midnight-themed UI.
